OL,6,     FMichael enjoys a cocktail at an
OL,7,     Fice bar before sculpting a leaping
OL,8,     Ffish from an ice block and later
OL,9,     Fexplores Sweden's greatest - but
OL,10,     Fill-fated - warship which sank on
OL,11,     Fits maiden voyage. (Ep3/3)
OL,12,G2200 Into Dinosaur Valley with Dan Snow
